<Base title="Terms & refunds – ShakeFree Mouse" description="The terms for buying and using ShakeFree Mouse: free trial, plans, cancelling and refunds." path="/terms" current="terms" mainClass="wrap narrow prose">
  <h1>Terms &amp; refunds</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated: 27 October 2026</p>

  <p>These terms explain how buying and using ShakeFree Mouse works. In short: <strong>try everything free for 5 days first, because purchases are not refunded.</strong> You can cancel a subscription at any time.</p>

  <h2>Who you’re buying from</h2>
  <p>ShakeFree Mouse is made by Wahlstrom Digital. Purchases are handled by <a href="https://www.lemonsqueezy.com">Lemon Squeezy</a>, which acts as the merchant of record: it takes your payment, handles taxes and sends your receipt. Lemon Squeezy’s <a href="https://www.lemonsqueezy.com/buyer-terms">buyer terms</a> also apply to your purchase.</p>

  <h2>Free trial</h2>
  <p>ShakeFree Mouse is downloaded free from Microsoft Store. The first time you start it, you get 5 days with every feature included. No card is needed. When the trial ends, ShakeFree Mouse pauses and your mouse works as normal until you enter a key.</p>

  <h2>Plans and payment</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Monthly:</strong> $5, renewed every month.</li>
    <li><strong>Yearly:</strong> $42, renewed every year.</li>
    <li><strong>Lifetime:</strong> $65, paid once and never renewed.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Every plan includes every feature. Prices include tax.</p>

  <h2>Your key</h2>
  <p>After buying, you get a key by email. One key works on up to 3 PCs at a time. To move it to another PC, choose <strong>Remove from this PC</strong> in the app’s settings first. Please don’t share your key beyond your own PCs.</p>

  <h2>Cancelling</h2>
  <p>You can cancel a Monthly or Yearly plan at any time, from <strong>Manage plan</strong> in the app or the link in your receipt email. It then won’t renew, and you keep using ShakeFree Mouse until the end of the period you’ve paid for.</p>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>Because you can try everything free for 5 days before buying, <strong>purchases and renewals are not refunded</strong>, and unused time on a cancelled plan is not paid back.</p>
  <p>If something has gone wrong with a payment, for example you were charged twice or by mistake, <a href="support.html">contact us</a> and we’ll put it right. This policy doesn’t affect any rights you have under the consumer law where you live.</p>

  <h2>What ShakeFree Mouse is</h2>
  <p>ShakeFree Mouse is an assistive app that makes the mouse pointer steadier. It is not a medical device or treatment. We work hard to make it reliable, but we can’t promise it will work with every program, mouse or setup. As far as the law allows, our responsibility is limited to the amount you paid.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If these terms change, we’ll update them here and change the date at the top. Changes never affect a period you’ve already paid for.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Wahlstrom Digital<br><a href="mailto:wahlstrom.ole@gmail.com">wahlstrom.ole@gmail.com</a></p>
